1 lb breast of turkey skinless boneless
1 1/2 q chicken broth
1 onion (1/2 lb)
1-2 canned chipotle chiles
1/2 c masa
15 oz can diced tomatoes

4-5 quart pot, simmer turkey & onion in broth till mostly
done (8-10 min)
shred meat
chop chiles
wisk masa into broth, boil with stirring and simmer 5 minutes
add meat & tomatoes to stew & heat till hot
serve with parsley or cilantro


